<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Merck, Roche AIDS drugs.</title>
<headline>EU clears Merck, Roche AIDS drugs.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said Friday it has approved the marketing two AIDS drugs by Merck &amp; Co. and Roche Holding Ltd. in the European Union.</p>
<p>Approval for Merck's Crixivan and Roche's Invirase came after a positive opinion from the London-based European drugs agency EMEA, a spokesman for the Commission said.</p>
</text>
